{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2014-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1389830400, "end_date": 1390521599, "month_true_total": 222, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:56:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "8823646", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044709391", "personaname": "Dad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044709391/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 721, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 614, "last_played": 1485071307, "avatar": "e1afa79f88f6acdf162a7cbf3d0bbbe79ff8a179"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fantastic game for MULTIPLE players, if you try this as a single player you will have a very difficult time, the more the better. Great gameplay, small download time, with 4 great unique classes.", "timestamp_created": 1390517464, "timestamp_updated": 1390517464, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8817821", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988296427", "personaname": "Xelu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xelubest/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 725, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "b6ff54b8e792ba7c1ed04adbbe3005994de5b04a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really nice game! First off, I think it's one of the most overlooked games (most likely because it's free so people instantly assume it's mediocre quality). \n\nThe downside to this game is that you only get half of the experience if you play alone. Playing with friends is way more interesting because each player can focus on his own role, allowing the others to specialize in something else, compared to playing alone where you have to be your own medic and your own engineer... so on. \n\nIt's quite a difficult game when you pay it the first time because it's going to be tricky to figure out what you have to do (which is not bad) but it might be slightly frustrating especially if you play with friends, you die and you have to start form the beginning. \n\nThere is a fair amount of variety when it comes to alien enemies and the game keeps throwing new things at you constantly, also graphic wise it looks quite good for a top down shooter, especially when a team member dies and the camera zooms on him and dramatically showcases his death in slow motion.\n\nThat being said, once you get the hang of it, you will feel amazing cooperating with the other players and playing quite strategically.\n\nThis game gets a thumbs up form me.. and I should play it again.", "timestamp_created": 1390478282, "timestamp_updated": 1390761104, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513513505458831787", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8816953", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984095893", "personaname": "Stainless", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197984095893/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 593, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 561, "last_played": 1482796153, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game. Co-op bug-hunt. Need more!", "timestamp_created": 1390468653, "timestamp_updated": 1390468653, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8816215", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038698371", "personaname": "iLL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/themaelstromite/", "num_games_owned": 99, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 428, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 417, "last_played": 1391743448, "avatar": "2ceedfeb8bed81d384d57d67f844cb531c0b3269"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its a repetitive game, however its merits are many. For a free game, its graphics and playstyle are quite clean, although there may be the occasional bug, its quite amazing how wel developped it is.", "timestamp_created": 1390458360, "timestamp_updated": 1390458360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8814409", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063997550", "personaname": "sNeezy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/realsNeezy/", "num_games_owned": 359, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 175, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86, "last_played": 1393713387, "avatar": "46b537ae8dd58cff841fac6532403d46bbdddabf"}, "language": "english", "review": "So Fun...... MUST GET ALL ACHIVEMENTS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1390442019, "timestamp_updated": 1390442572, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions